[I] Library to extract technical metadata from media files (MediaInfo)

[T] MediaInfoLib provides a convenient unified display of the most relevant
[T] technical and tag data for video and audio files, exposed as a C++ library
[T] that the MediaInfo tools build on.

[U] https://github.com/MediaArea/MediaInfoLib

